        "html": "<div class=\"text\">The one thing an internal platform can't give you is an in-house compliance expert who's done hundreds of audits. Is there someone internally who owns the advisory side, or is it purely the tooling?</div><div class=\"text\">A platform is one part of it, but what happens when you hit a grey area in your audit scope, or a control that doesn't map cleanly? Is there an expert behind your internal build or is that on your team to figure out?</div>",
